WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.066
This slide focuses on What is a class Start with the
meaning of the idea

00:00:05.289 --> 00:00:11.134
then connect it to the example and the larger
analytical workflow A class

00:00:11.147 --> 00:00:17.466
is a blueprint An object is one item created from
that blueprint Attributes

00:00:17.492 --> 00:00:23.007
store information Methods perform actions The

00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:25.349
word self means this specific object
